## Technical Notes
- **OB v4 channel 165481 incomeVerificationType — verified accepted (2026-05-21)**
  FullDoc | WrittenVOE | AssetRelated | Stated | NoIncomeVerification |
  InvestorDscr | PersonalBankStmt12Mos | PersonalBankStmt24Mos |
  BusinessBankStmt12Mos | BusinessBankStmt24Mos
- **Bank-statement enum casing is case-AND-shape-sensitive.** Required
  exactly: `Personal` or `Business` + `BankStmt` (abbreviated, NOT
  `BankStatement`) + `12Mos`/`24Mos` (plural `Mos`, NOT `Mo` or `12`).
- **borrowerInformation requires IncomeDocumentation, AssetDocumentation,
  and EmploymentDocumentation** — undocumented in OB sample JSON but
  enforced by channel 165481 with HTTP 400 if omitted. All three now
  hardcoded to 'Verified'.
- **expandedGuidelines sibling `standard` block** is sent only when
  documentationType === 'fullDoc'. Routes OB to evaluate both Standard
  agency and Expanded Guidelines families simultaneously.
- **/ineligible endpoint response shape** — wrapper object with
  `ineligibleProducts: [{ productName, productId, investor,
  ineligibleReason: [strings] (SINGULAR), ineligibleStatus, ... }]`.
  Parser handles both singular + plural variants now.
- **Brand asset path** /public/tql-tpo-logo-bw.svg — served by Vite at
  root /tql-tpo-logo-bw.svg. 47KB file (embeds a PNG inside the SVG;
  not optimized — fine for now).
- **Resend FROM enforcement** at api/send-email.ts. Any value not
  ending in @tqltpo.com or @tqlend.com (and equivalent subdomains)
  falls back to TQLQuote@tqltpo.com.

